<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- None. The app is not sandboxed, loads no plug-ins, and generates no code at run time, so the hardened runtime
     needs no exception. Add a key here only for a failure that names it, with the reason beside it. -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
